<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant Islamist insurgents in Cabo Delgado have continued attacks, including a transformer theft that halted night flights at Lichinga Airport and caused 20.5 million meticais in losses. Mozambican security forces captured six alleged terrorists in Macomia while the United States is weighing training Mozambican special forces as Islamic State threatens regional shipping. Energy investor Eni announced it will leave the mega Rovuma LNG project to focus on floating liquefaction, removing a major player from the area. Mozambique is seeking $37.2 billion in climate finance at the COP31 summit. There were 151 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTE1uTl9INzY4ZUlzUlpINVd6S1lUbVhDVkNaQ01sX3lQWjZwS0hrbWdUZEVQWjJ5U3NNNG1Udm1MOTgwTnQtcV9ZcTFvZGRGanI5enAwN1hZVkd1djFSTXpueWdlRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Mail&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQQVdFemVILVVFdGFQWk1heE5Ka2pLQS1FQ1Nad1U0TUcwcTZ4ZXhrU2QzOXc2dENkX0VOaXMwSzRFVlVOZzJjRjFmTmZOQ1NUZ0dib2swdUJKUEk1ekhodHV4Y1RDUTNjMTNEZC1OYWtlTXc1ZGRnX0M1STJ6NlpBd3BGLTRwb2h3d2s3eUp3NzRZN1ZPYS1oaUptNzRSMDVL?oc=5&quot;&gt;UrduPoint&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxNQWRpTmxVM3gwY3prXzZQOXhvbzdBS0JwbHlXUjY1d0hjNnRZRTJpZ1VYek11cFBkRGktUkktUUE1NkJlcklOeDlCdUY0NEtTanJTaDNSeUxWT1UyS0VOa1h4VnQ5Q3ZHVXBCYlRiRU5TYi1WZ2RDSzZ5ejRZbFk0VEZIbXRnYlNaR1RneTBGd2NzRWJyb1ZrSkQya250cWc0TWx4Z282dlo3RVh2RF9sX1JLd29wSFdxc1RFNkJMVDhwWGs?oc=5&quot;&gt;National Security News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Club of Mozambique&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxQS0FuV1N3ZmNadmRCd0lyX3o3N1BaLWFFN0puY1o3TDA2Zn